# Domains that are confirmed live for real users but block automated
# link checkers (bot/WAF protection) or are otherwise consistently
# flaky in a specific, known way. Unlike .lycheeignore, these domains
# are still actually requested every run - a failure here is only
# dropped from the report if its status TAG matches what's listed
# below. Any other status (a real 404, a dead connection, a changed
# error code, ...) still gets reported normally, so we keep real
# regression detection instead of losing the domain entirely.
#
# Format: <substring-of-the-URL><TAB><lychee status tag>
# One line per known (domain, expected-status) pair. See
# scripts/filter-expected-failures.py.
